cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Seatbelt Bench in your research or product evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "Seatbelt Bench: a decision corpus for AI-agent tool-call gating"
authors:
  - name: "Ghost Developer Studio"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/littlestjames82-sys/agent-seatbelt"
abstract: >-
  206 labeled cases (deny / ask / allow / defer) for pre-tool safety
  gating of AI coding agents, including shell-evasion patterns,
  prompt-injection controls, and cases derived from eight real public
  agent incidents, with a frozen-id versioning policy and an
  external-runner scoring interface.
